# Media that the archive does not need.
#
# pub.dev never reads README images out of the .tar.gz. It rewrites every <img>
# to an external-images.pub.dev proxy pointing back at GitHub raw, so these
# files only have to exist on the main branch. Excluding them took the download
# from 1004 KB to 73 KB.
#
# Anything listed under pubspec's `screenshots:` is the exception: that path is
# read from the archive and publishing fails when it is missing. searchable-grid.png
# is therefore deliberately absent from this list.
#
# This file shadows a .gitignore in doc/ only, and there is none.
demo.gif
banner.png
banner.svg
blog/
